                                            class="text-white font-mono"
                                            >+1.5%</span
                                        > buffer to your final calculation.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5"
